Package: pkginspectr
Title: Tidy Tools for Inspecting and Comparing R Package Structure
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Dauber", , "daniel.dauber.io@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Inspect the structure and source code of R packages from local
    folders, 'GitHub' repositories or 'CRAN'. Summarise file counts, folder
    structure and lines of code (blank, comment, 'roxygen', function and test
    lines) as tidy tibbles. Lines are classified with R's own parser, and
    files excluded by '.Rbuildignore' are skipped, so local folders and
    released packages can be compared on equal terms. Compare several
    packages side by side and visualise the results as Unicode bar charts in
    the console.
